 Wednesday ✅.

 Today's newsletter is 865 words, a 3½-minute read. 

 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 0.2%.

 🥶 Today's stock spotlight: Caterpillar (-5.8%) and Deere &amp; Co. (-3.8%) fell with other farm equipment manufacturers after the FTC and the Department of Agriculture announced a public inquiry into "potential anticompetitive conduct" in ag equipment manufacturing and distribution markets.

 
 
