 3. Other happenings 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella, speaking at Microsoft's Windows event in San Francisco on Wednesday. Photo: Ina Fried/Axios

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 💻 Microsoft 's new Surface Laptop Ultra, which contains an Nvidia AI chip, will start at $2,599. The laptop allows users to run large AI models directly on the device. ( Axios )

 📺 Disney said this year's Super Bowl — airing on ESPN and ABC — will also stream on Disney+. ( ESPN )

 💸 Fed officials worried that higher costs tied to energy, AI investment and other shocks could spill over into broader, more persistent inflation, according to minutes from its Sept. 15-16 meeting. ( Axios )

 
 
